:: Inn room 1 {"position":"4275,1275","size":"100,100"}
You go in your room.
There's a comfy bed to the right and a desk with a book on it, next to your bed.
There's a wardrobe right next to it.
On the wall next to you bed there's a sign. It says <span class=Evese> "Don't forget that you need to pay 320 col per day!"</span> <<linkreplace "Translate">> <<if $ReadingSkill == 1>> You don't understand what the text says... At all. <<elseif $ReadingSkill == 2>> .... you can see that it has something to do with payment. <<elseif $ReadingSkill == 3>> Don't ??? about some payment. <<elseif $ReadingSkill == 4>> Don't forget about some payment. <<elseif $ReadingSkill == 5>> Don't forget about a payment with 500 col. <<elseif $ReadingSkill == 6>> The sign says "Don't forget that you need to pay 320 col per day!"<</if>> <<set $ReadingXP += 5>><</linkreplace>>

